// Survival patrol scenario for Worldwake.
//
// Purpose: keep the survival loop alive while a watch agent performs an
// authored patrol route and has enough local memory to pursue a hostile target
// believed to be at a remote route endpoint.
//
// Lawful competing affordances intentionally constrained:
// - one guard owns the survival-health envelope; the fugitive is a supporting
//   hostile target for pursuit
// - food and water come from ordinary harvest sources at route places
// - combat profile is supporting substrate for the pursuit terminal action,
//   not the row-owned combat/bandit-camp landing
(
    seed: 614014,
    survival_health_contract: (
        max_authored_critical_run_ticks: 160,
        max_idle_window_ticks_with_elevated_need: 40,
